{{Term/Store|Stamella Shroom|Stamella Shrooms|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Spoils"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Stamella Shroom}}
Stamella Shrooms can be found growing near [[Tree]]s. Due to their bright green coloration, they can difficult to spot among [[Grass]]. They can also be purchased at the [[Spore Store]] in the [[Great Hyrule Forest]] or from [[Bugut]] the [[Wandering Merchant]]. Stamella Shrooms can be eaten as is to restore one [[Heart]] in Link's [[Life Gauge]], but can also be [[Cooking|Cooked]] into more fulfilling [[Food]]s that grants [[Stamina Restoration]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> When a Stamella Shroom is exposed to [[Fire]], it turns into a [[Toasty Stamella Shroom]]. They can be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to create Green [[Dye]].

